From 1fbfc770327217e9cbd8b455c9d9560ee51bbfc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:27:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 42/46] Challenge settings and Nuzlocke mode, Repel prompt,
 modern shiny odds

- A challenge menu on the first morning: Nuzlocke mode, level caps, no
  items in battle and the Set battle style.
- Nuzlocke: first encounter per area (dupes and shiny clauses; one-time
  encounters exempt), permanent fainting, and blacking out ends the run.
- Repel wears off -> offer to use another of the same kind.
- Shiny odds 1/4096; the Shiny Charm from Oak's aide after the Champion
  gives two extra rolls.
- tools/hack/exp_budget.py and tools/hack/save_check.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
